        "content": "--- title: \"Ghayb, Muraqabah, and the Non-Advantage of Concealment -- A Theological Foundation for Observation-Invariant AI Safety\" author: Bilal Syed Arfeen date: Independent Researcher subject: \"Ghayb, muraqabah, Non-Advantage of Concealment, observation-invariant safety, AI alignment, structural honesty, Islamic theology, SHUDP, SHIELD\" ---",
